---
import SitePage from "../layouts/SitePage.astro";
---

<SitePage
  title={"Our Mission — Golden Recruiting"}
  description={
    "Why Golden Recruiting exists: to make hiring feel human again, for the companies doing it and the people going through it."
  }
  heading={"Why we do this"}
  intro={
    "Hiring is one of the most personal decisions a company makes. It deserves a personal approach."
  }
>
  <section
    aria-labelledby="mission"
    class="border-b border-line py-14 sm:py-20"
  >
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="mission" class="text-3xl leading-snug">
        Our mission
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
        To make hiring feel human again, for the companies doing it and the
        people going through it.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[70ch] text-ink-dim">
        We've seen what happens when a hire is rushed: good people in the wrong
        seats, and teams paying for it. We've also seen what one right hire can
        do. Golden exists to make the second story more common.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section
    aria-labelledby="beliefs"
    class="border-b border-line py-14 sm:py-20"
  >
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="beliefs" class="text-3xl leading-snug">
        What we believe
      </h2>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-ink-dim">
        <li>
          Hiring is about people, not paperwork. A resume tells you where
          someone has been. A conversation tells you where they're going.
        </li>
        <li>
          Honesty is a kindness. We tell clients when a search needs rethinking,
          and we tell candidates when a role isn't right for them.
        </li>
        <li>
          Small is a strength. Golden is founder-led on purpose. You get Bri's
          attention, her network, and her name on the work.
        </li>
        <li>
          The job isn't done at the offer. We check in after the start date,
          with you and with the person you hired.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="book" class="border-b border-line py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="book" class="text-3xl leading-snug">
        Sound like the way you'd want to hire?
      </h2>
      <a class="btn mt-6" href="/contact">
        Book a call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SitePage>
